# The Spanish data protection agency's public FAQ.
# Chosen because every entry is a question: this is the only corpus here
# that puts `es.unpaired-question` in front of several hundred correctly
# opened interrogatives, where each finding is a suspected false positive.
# Frozen 2026-08-09. region: <main>
#
# A second column is an Internet Archive capture: fixed bytes, so a rebuild
# reproduces instead of resampling. A URL without one is fetched live, and
# `--live` ignores the column entirely. gates/README.md has the coverage.
